### System continuation (prior runner closure; whole system now reopened)

- Author `/root`; manager `/root/design_manager`; involved, user decision owner.
  Current delta SHA-256: `e51b34036bba77ae0e0d80ac919f4acdb9f1e9541710406623d50726a49160b2`.
